sequenceDiagram
  participant DG as Diagnostics loop (in bot)
  participant WD as GatewayWatchdog
  participant F as status.json / bot.log / counters.json
  participant SY as synthetic.timer (hourly)
  participant WK as weekly.timer (Sat 10:00 PT)
  participant RT as Box nightly check-in (~8 PM PT)
  participant VM as VM via IAP SSH
  participant E as Operator
  loop every 15 s tick, wall-clock deadline
    DG->>DG: wall vs monotonic gap > threshold?
    opt host freeze detected
      DG->>F: counters.bump(freeze)
    end
  end
  DG->>F: light check every 600 s (gateway, loop, DB write, KB search, log, disk)
  DG->>F: full check every 3600 s (+Gemini, pipeline, REST guild, commands, catch-up, DB size)
  WD->>F: stale status / freeze → bump counter, recover
  SY->>SY: ~25 checks on throwaway DB copy (~7 Gemini calls)
  SY->>F: "ok 25/25" or FAIL line
  WK->>F: trim bot.log, DB maintenance if needed
  RT->>VM: heartbeat_check_gcp.sh
  RT->>VM: pull_from_vm.sh → vm_mirror/
  RT->>RT: scan changed Drive docs (example.edu)
  opt knowledge changed
    RT->>VM: push_knowledge.sh (add/update, live reindex)
  end
  RT->>E: short report every night (health, additions, issues)
  Note over RT: Saturday recap uses same pull/push path
